---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /packages/
title: "Nail, Brow & Holiday Beauty Packages in Liverpool | By Hannah Beauty"
description: "Beauty packages from £32 at By Hannah Beauty, Walton: nails and brows, holiday prep with gel nails, pedicure and waxing. Book on Treatwell."
---
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Beauty packages in Walton, Liverpool</h1>
        <p class="page-intro">Each package puts a few treatments into one appointment and costs less than booking them one by one. They're popular before holidays, proms and nights out.</p>
        <p class="page-rating">★ {{ site.rating.value }} from {{ site.rating.count }} verified reviews on Treatwell</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="prices">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="package-detail-list">
          {%- for p in packages.onTreatwell %}
          <article class="package-detail">
            <h2>{{ p.name }}</h2>
            <p class="package-detail-meta"><strong>{{ p.price }}</strong> <s>{{ p.usualPrice }}</s> · {{ p.duration }}</p>
            <p>{{ p.includes }}</p>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.bookingUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book on Treatwell</a>
          </article>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faqs">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Mummy &amp; Me and other occasions</h2>
        <p class="package-detail-text">I also do <a href="/mummy-and-me/">Mummy &amp; Me nail appointments</a> for one adult and one child. If you're getting ready for a prom or a holiday and want something that isn't listed here, <a href="{{ site.instagramDmUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">message me on Instagram</a> and tell me what you have in mind.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
